  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Norec, FK Norway, personnell exchange</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project focuses on training young farmers on organic agriculture and business skills. The aim of the project is to discourage urban migration in their operating regions of India and Nepal. After the onset of covid-19 the project amended its focus to target returned migrant workers to assist them in setting up kitchen gardens and organic small-scale farms to help them avoid starvation and falling into extreme poverty. India and Nepal.</narrative>
  </description>
